        "id": 1148900
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-08-21T03:13:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Well, the tricky part is that we don\u0027t want to update dptf profile when entering/existing tablet mode. Instead, we want to update dptf when entering/existing 360 mode. So we do need to check gmr sensor GPIO in the callback. Or we have to implement something like tablet_360_get_mode() and use it to keep track of 360 mode.",
      "parentUuid": "f6b92287_62b702d4",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 84,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 103,
        "endChar": 38
      },
      "revId": "de8b7c3a37ee67bb82d0717792ec118b6b9f1f37",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "77a35083_fb2d9924",
        "filename": "common/tablet_mode.c",
