        "id": 1259838
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-08-22T15:40:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah, I see the distinction now. Yes we should break it out in to a first-class tablet_360_get_mode() API.\n\nNot all chromebooks will have a 360 hall sensor. If a chromebook doesn\u0027t have the 360 hall sensor, but the lid angle calculation (based on accel readings) is \u003e350 degrees, do you still want to enable this DPTF setting?",
      "parentUuid": "152c48bf_2c505e62",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 84,
        "startChar": 1,
