      "writtenOn": "2019-08-23T07:34:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For DPTF, we are concerned about the 360-degree mode. Skin temperature thresholds need to be lower only when the device is in completely flipped 360-degree mode. Doing it at 200-degree would cause throttling to happen sooner than required.",
      "parentUuid": "cc6f247b_4ae50cc9",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 84,
